class ImportPengguna extends Command {
    protected $signature = 'pengguna:import {fail} {--chunk=500}';
    public function handle(): int {
        $fail = $this->argument('fail');
        if (! file_exists($fail)) { $this->error('Tiada fail.'); return self::FAILURE; }
        $bar = $this->output->createProgressBar();
        foreach (array_chunk(file($fail), (int) $this->option('chunk')) as $ketul) {
            foreach ($ketul as $baris) { /* proses + dispatch job */ }
            $bar->advance(count($ketul));
        }
        $bar->finish();
        $this->info('Siap.');
        return self::SUCCESS;
    }
}
```
Chunk mengelak OOM (fail besar!), bar tunjuk kemajuan, kod keluar kontrak. Queue per baris untukCommand::FAILURE untuk skrip panggil (CI!).

